# Forbidden client-specific names
#
# This file is used by the pre-commit hook (scripts/hooks/block_api_keys.sh)
# to prevent client-specific language from entering the template repository.
#
# Copy this file to .forbidden_names (gitignored) and add your client's name
# and any other client-specific identifiers that shouldn't appear in commits.
#
# One name per line. Case-insensitive. Word boundaries enforced.
# Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Example:
# AcmeCorp
# Acme
# BigClient Inc
